🏷️ 低倍率 = url-test, policy-path=https://sub.example.com/airport?token=demo, update-interval=3600, external-policy-modifier="udp-relay=true", policy-regex-filter="(?:^|[^0-9.])0?\\\\.\\\\d+\\\\s*[xX×倍]|(?:^|[^A-Za-z0-9])[xX×]\\\\s*0?\\\\.\\\\d+|低倍率|低倍|免费|免費|公益|福利|试用|試用|low[ _-]?rate|discount", interval=300, tolerance=50
🏠 家宽 / 原生 = url-test, policy-path=https://sub.example.com/airport?token=demo, update-interval=3600, external-policy-modifier="udp-relay=true", policy-regex-filter="家宽|家寬|住宅|商宽|商寬|原生|双ISP|雙ISP|(?:^|[^A-Za-z])(?:ISP|Residential|Home[ _-]?Broadband|Comcast|Verizon|Spectrum|AT&T|Hinet|So-net)(?:$|[^A-Za-z])", interval=300, tolerance=50
🚄 专线 (IPLC / IEPL) = url-test, policy-path=https://sub.example.com/airport?token=demo, update-interval=3600, external-policy-modifier="udp-relay=true", policy-regex-filter=专线|專線|深港|沪港|滬港|沪日|滬日|京德|粤港|粵港|广港|廣港|莞港|过境|過境|CN2\\s*GIA|(?:^|[^A-Za-z])(?:IPLC|IEPL|EPL|AIA|Dedicated)(?:$|[^A-Za-z]), interval=300, tolerance=50
🎮 游戏 = url-test, policy-path=https://sub.example.com/airport?token=demo, update-interval=3600, external-policy-modifier="udp-relay=true", policy-regex-filter="游戏|遊戲|低延迟|低延遲|全锥形|加速器|(?:^|[^A-Za-z])(?:Gaming|Game|Low[ _-]?Latency|Full[ _-]?Cone|UDP|Steam|PSN|Xbox|Switch|NAT1)(?:$|[^A-Za-z])", interval=300, tolerance=50
🔁 故障转移 = fallback, 🚄 专线 (IPLC / IEPL), 🇭🇰 香港节点, 🇸🇬 新加坡节点, 🇯🇵 日本节点, interval=300
🇭🇰 香港节点 = url-test, policy-path=https://sub.example.com/airport?token=demo, update-interval=3600, external-policy-modifier="udp-relay=true", policy-regex-filter="(?i)🇭🇰|香港|深港|沪港|滬港|京港|广港|廣港|港线|港線|港服|Hong[ _-]?Kong|HongKong|Hong-Kong|Hong_Kong|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:HK|HKG)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<!东|東|空|海)(?<!连云|連雲|防城|张家|張家|高雄)(?<!鹿特丹|新加坡)港(?!口|台)", interval=300, tolerance=50
🇹🇼 台湾节点 = url-test, policy-path=https://sub.example.com/airport?token=demo, update-interval=3600, external-policy-modifier="udp-relay=true", policy-regex-filter=(?i)🇹🇼|台湾|台灣|台北|臺北|台中|臺中|高雄|台南|臺南|彰化|桃园|桃園|新北|新竹|中华电信|中華電信|Taiwan|Taipei|Taichung|Kaohsiung|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:Hinet)(?![A-Za-z])|Chunghwa|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:TW|TWN|TPE|KHH)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<!平|后|後|前|电|電|烟|煙|邢|茅|天|站|中|舞|讲|櫃|柜)(?<!电视|電視|控制)台(?!风)|(?<!平)臺, interval=300, tolerance=50
