🇸🇬 新加坡节点 = url-test, policy-path=https://sub.example.com/airport?token=demo, update-interval=3600, external-policy-modifier="udp-relay=true", policy-regex-filter=(?i)🇸🇬|新加坡|狮城|獅城|坡县|坡縣|星加坡|新线|新線|Singapore|Singtel|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:SG|SGP|SIN)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<!更|最|全|刷|重|创|創)新(?!西兰|西蘭|疆|北|竹|品|手|节点|節點|地址|域名|用户|用戶), interval=300, tolerance=50
